<title>USA: Chico's FAS nominates two directors.</title>
<headline>Chico's FAS nominates two directors.</headline>
<dateline>FORT MYERS, Fla. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chico's FAS Inc on Friday said its directors nominated Ross Roeder and John Burden as independent directors for election at the company's annual meeting scheduled for June 17.</p>
<p>Chico's, a retailer of women's casual clothing, also said it completed its negotiations with its former president, Melissa Payner, in connection with her separation from the company.</p>
